1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
Glacial lake floods destroy bridges in Pakistan's north.

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,460
But clouds hide the lakes.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,400
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees through them.

4
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:12,360
So we built SARtale. Pick a lake.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,190
Each pass gives its water area,

6
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:18,330
compared with that lake's own normal range.

7
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,688
Passu's flag began with a processing update.

8
00:00:21,728 --> 00:00:23,060
It needs checking.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,230
Anyone can request a lake.

10
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:28,750
When clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
